.TH PROWSE-TUI 1 "September 2026" "ProwseTk" "Prowse-TUI Help"
.SH NAME
prowse-tui \- programmable terminal browser and help pager
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prowse-TUI presents Flatworm pages in a terminal. Press : to enter a command.
The help pager is independent of the live page. Closing it restores the page
and its scroll position; help navigation never replaces the live session.
.SH NAVIGATION
Use j and k or the arrow keys to move the cursor. Space and PageDown advance
a screen; b and PageUp go back. g goes to the top and G to the bottom.
Enter, l or Right follows the selected hyperlink. h or Left goes back.
Esc or q closes help. In the browser q quits. F1 opens help and F2 opens config.
.SH HELP COMMANDS
.TP
.B :help
Open this overview.
.TP
.B :help list
Open the selectable help index. Move with j/k or Up/Down and press Enter.
.TP
.B :help open commands
Open the named help page.
.TP
.B :help find regex
Search all rendered help pages. Select a result to open its matching line.
.SH SEARCH
Press / to enter a POSIX extended regex within the current help view.
Press n for the next matching line and ? for the previous matching line.
Search wraps at either end. Matching lines are highlighted.
.SH TOPICS
.UR help:commands
Browser and automation commands
